# AI safety

The LLM summarises and extracts. It does not award tenders, score bids, or publish.

- Worker writes `ai_analyses` only (`needs_review`). It does not update `tenders.closing_at`, requirements, or criteria.
- Operational fields change only after a procurement officer sets `review_status` to `approved` or `corrected`.
- Show AI text as "suggested" in the UI until reviewed.
- Prompts must not ask the model to decide a winner or invent mandatory requirements that are not in the source document.
- Log model name on `ai_analyses.model`. Treat extraction JSON as untrusted input.
